    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a multi-ending horror game set in Japan.<br>The story branches based on the player's choices, leading to different endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by the <strong>Satori</strong>, a mythical creature from Japanese folklore with the ability to read people's minds.<br>Its power serves as a key element that creates fear and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player explores eerie shrines and dimly lit mansions,<br>they must uncover the hidden secrets within.<br>Will you be able to reach the truth of this strange world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on puzzle-solving elements and branching storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single choice may have a significant impact on your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Let\u2019s Play Videos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We <strong>welcome</strong> gameplay videos and live streams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Request</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer of this game is a <strong>first-time creator</strong> and a <strong>high school student</strong> with no professional experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be some rough edges, but we would greatly appreciate your understanding.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a multi-ending horror game set in Japan.<br>The story branches based on the player's choices, leading to different endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by the <strong>Satori</strong>, a mythical creature from Japanese folklore with the ability to read people's minds.<br>Its power serves as a key element that creates fear and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player explores eerie shrines and dimly lit mansions,<br>they must uncover the hidden secrets within.<br>Will you be able to reach the truth of this strange world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on puzzle-solving elements and branching storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single choice may have a significant impact on your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Let\u2019s Play Videos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We <strong>welcome</strong> gameplay videos and live streams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Request</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer of this game is a <strong>first-time creator</strong> and a <strong>high school student</strong> with no professional experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be some rough edges, but we would greatly appreciate your understanding.</p>",
